### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@adminUser = admin
@adminPass = Admin@123456

### ============================================================
### COOKIE-BASED LOGIN (Admin Panel)
### ============================================================

### Login as Admin (Cookie Auth)
# @name loginCookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

loginIdentifier={{adminUser}}&password={{adminPass}}&ReturnUrl=/

### Check cookie from loginCookie
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Cookie: {{loginCookie.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### Logout (Cookie Auth)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

### ============================================================
### OAUTH2 - AUTHORIZATION CODE FLOW (with PKCE)
### ============================================================

### Step 1: Generate PKCE code_verifier and code_challenge
# @name pkce
# The code_verifier should be 43-128 characters from [A-Z] / [a-z] / [0-9] / "-" / "." / "_" / "~"
# The code_challenge is BASE64URL(SHA256(code_verifier))

### Step 2: Get Authorization Code
# Open this URL in browser to get the authorization code from redirect
# NOTE: Replace CODE_CHALLENGE with actual SHA256 hash of your code_verifier
GET {{baseUrl}}/connect/authorize?
    &client_id=OroIdentityServer.Admin
    &response_type=code
    &scope=openid profile email roles offline_access admin
    &redirect_uri=http://localhost:30645
    &state=abc123
    &code_challenge=YOUR_CODE_CHALLENGE
    &code_challenge_method=S256

### Step 3: Exchange Authorization Code for Tokens
# @name tokenAuthCode
POST {{baseUrl}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code
&client_id=OroIdentityServer.Admin
&code=YOUR_AUTHORIZATION_CODE
&redirect_uri=http://localhost:30645
&code_verifier=YOUR_CODE_VERIFIER

### ============================================================
### CLIENT CREDENTIALS FLOW
### ============================================================

### Get token using Client Credentials
# @name tokenClientCredentials
POST {{baseUrl}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials
&client_id=YOUR_CLIENT_ID
&client_secret=YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET
&scope=admin

### ============================================================
### REFRESH TOKEN
### ============================================================

### Refresh Access Token
# @name refreshToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token
&client_id=OroIdentityServer.Admin
&refresh_token=YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN

### ============================================================
### USERINFO ENDPOINT
### ============================================================

### Get User Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/connect/userinfo
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAuthCode.response.body.access_token}}

### ============================================================
### END SESSION (LOGOUT)
### ============================================================

### Logout (OIDC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/connect/logout?
    &id_token_hint=YOUR_ID_TOKEN
    &post_logout_redirect_uri=http://localhost:30645
